; rowsum_row_out_of_range: a row at the grid extent must raise.
;
; The grid is 1x3, so the only valid row is 0. Row 1 addresses no line of
; the grid: the Rust VM used to sum absent coefficients to 0 while
; xqvm_py raised, so this vector pins IndexOutOfBounds on both.
;
; The grid is deliberately not square. The Rust helper that validates a
; grid-addressed operand takes the axis extent as a bare parameter the
; caller supplies, and against a square grid handing it the column count
; where the row count belongs changes nothing observable.

PUSH 3
BQMX r0

PUSH 1           ; rows
PUSH 3           ; cols
RESIZE r0

PUSH 1           ; row == rows
ROWSUM r0
HALT
